  "mil7.1:48.1": "Cakkavākassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:49.1": "Peṇāhikāya dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:50.1": "Gharakapoṭassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:51.1": "Ulūkassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:52.1": "Satapattassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:53.1": "Vaggulissa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:54.1": "Jalūkāya ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:55.1": "Sappassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:56.1": "Ajagarassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:57.1": "",
  "mil7.1:58.1": "Panthamakkaṭakassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:59.1": "Thanasitadārakassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:60.1": "Cittakadharakummassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:61.1": "Pavanassa pañca angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:62.1": "Rukkhassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:63.1": "Meghassa pañca angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:64.1": "Maṇiratanassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:65.1": "Māgavikassa cattāri angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:66.1": "Bāḷisikassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:67.1": "Tacchakassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:68.1": "",
  "mil7.1:69.1": "Kumbhassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:70.1": "Kāḷāyasassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:71.1": "Chattassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:72.1": "Khettassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:73.1": "Agadassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
