  "mil7.1:78.1": "Dovārikassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:79.1": "Nisadāya ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:80.1": "Padīpassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:81.1": "Mayūrassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:82.1": "Turangassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:83.1": "Soṇḍikassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:84.1": "Indakhīlassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:85.1": "Tulāya ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:86.1": "Khaggassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:87.1": "Macchassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:88.1": "Iṇagāhakassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:89.1": "Byādhitassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:90.1": "Matassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:91.1": "Nadiyā dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:92.1": "Usabhassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:93.1": "Maggassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:94.1": "Sunkasāyikassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:95.1": "Corassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:96.1": "Sakuṇagghiyā ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:97.1": "Sunakhassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:98.1": "Tikicchakassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:99.1": "Gabbhiniyā dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:100.1": "Camariyā ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:101.1": "Kikiyā dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:102.1": "Kapotikāya tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:103.1": "Ekanayanassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:104.1": "Kassakassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:105.1": "Jambukasigāliyā ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:106.1": "Cangavārakassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:107.1": "Dabbiyā ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:108.1": "Iṇasādhakassa tīṇi angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:109.1": "Anuvicinakassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:110.1": "Sārathissa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:111.1": "Bhojakassa dve angāni gahetabbāni. ",
  "mil7.1:112.1": "Tunnavāyassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:113.1": "Nāvāyikassa ekaṃ angaṃ gahetabbaṃ. ",
  "mil7.1:114.1": "Bhamarassa dve angāni gahetabbānīti. ",
